    "body": "The first part (making some HTML elements work in SVG) is an SVGWG-approved thing, with implementor approval.\n\nAltering embedded-SVG parsing hasn't been _explicitly_ discussed much, but it's an obvious outgrowth, given that it's _impossible_ to do html-namespace elements in embedded SVG currently.\n\n(In particular, wanting `<picture>`/`srcset` in SVG _is_ something I've heard from authors, for obvious reasons.)\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
