    "created_at": "2016-08-20T16:07:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-20T16:07:32Z",
    "body": "For cross-reference, the issue on the SVG WG spec tracking this: https://github.com/w3c/svgwg/issues/240\n\nI would definitely agree with @tabatkins that SVG's adoption of iframe, canvas, video, and audio is of limited use without HTML parser recognition.\n\nI would be more cautious about picture (which SVG doesn't yet recognize) and custom elements (since SVG would like to eventually be able to define our own custom elements, which can be created as extensions of SVGElement, not HTMLElement).\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
