    "created_at": "2016-11-01T06:44:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-01T06:44:49Z",
    "body": "For reference, we've discussed the possibilities for better integrating HTML and SVG many times in the past including a few members of the SVG WG meeting up with Hixie over lunch a few years back to discuss this ([notes](https://www.w3.org/Graphics/SVG/WG/wiki/F2F/TPAC_2014/HTML_integration_again)). I I think this has had pretty significant discussion and the proposal here is fairly conservative but still very useful. (Not sure about `<picture>` or custom elements, but we need to do something about `<template>` too.)\n\nAn external contributor is interested in implementing this in Gecko so I'd like to resolve this issue.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
