    "created_at": "2016-11-01T07:24:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-01T07:24:10Z",
    "body": "I'm pretty sure tests would be included in the PR Tab is offering to write 😉\n\n@hsivonen, @rniwa, @zcorpan, @pmeenan, @sideshowbarker, @jacobrossi any concerns about making the HTML parser put a limited whitelist of HTML elements (iframe/video/audio/canvas) in an SVG subtree in the HTML namespace? (None of the elements in the list trigger HTML's \"escape foreign content mode\" behavior.)\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/257504378/reactions",
